You can replace `K.mean(K.abs(y_true - y_pred))` with your own custom loss function, as per your requirements. This could be anything from mean squared error for regression problems, categorical cross-entropy for classification problems, etc.

Remember to compile the model by passing the name of your custom loss function (as a string) to `loss=...` in the `compile()` method. 

